																								<r3d:remarks>Description: Summit Station is a US National Science Foundation-funded research station on the Greenland ice cap.  The website offers near-real time weather summaries and a webcam.  Other data associated with the Summit Station can be found through the International Arctic Systems for Observing the Atmosphere (IASOA) website: http://iasoa.org or from Greenland Environmental Observatory at geosummit.org</r3d:remarks>
